<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">DEN OF NALORAKK · MYTHIC+ · ELEMENTAL SHAMAN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">元素萨满</span><span class="dot">·</span>纳洛拉克的洞穴 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">纳洛拉克的洞穴全程是<b>无视护甲的全团物理咆哮、流血与冰霜持续伤</b>，尾王回响重击单次约 101 万。元素萨满没有免疫，靠 90 秒<b>星界转移</b>盯紧固定点：囤宝狂人首发咆哮与第五发饕餮怒吼、寒冬哨兵寒冰暴雨、战争使者原始回响与纳洛拉克的回响重击；<b>清毒图腾</b>清腐坏补给后的剧毒孢子，<b>净化灵魂</b>驱饥荒雕像的饥肠辘辘，<b>土元素</b>（3 分钟）补星界空档。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时元素萨满（国 / 欧）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>先知</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>囤宝狂人</a>
      <a href="#s3">冰川</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>寒冬哨兵</a>
      <a href="#s5">图腾区</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>纳洛拉克</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条驱散边界与五组必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:108271}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">星界转移</div><div class="cd">90 秒（位面旅行者）· 持续 12 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>所有伤害 −40%。全本唯一大减伤，优先留给下方路线里标「必做」的高压机制。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:198103}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">土元素</div><div class="cd">3 分钟 · 持续 30 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>配始源羁绊不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%。补星界空档，主要用在尾王回响重击，囤宝狂人与冰川转好可兜底。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">清毒图腾</div><div class="cd">2 分钟 · 持续 6 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>脚下 30 码每 1.5 秒清一名队友全部中毒。专清囤宝狂人腐坏补给之后的<b>剧毒孢子</b>。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:51886}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">净化灵魂</div><div class="cd">8 秒 · 移除全部诅咒</div></div></div>
      <p>驱饥荒雕像的<b>饥肠辘辘</b>（最大生命值 −15%，可叠加），开场两波和林道叠层就驱。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">没有免疫 · 认清驱散边界</div>
    <b>清毒图腾</b>只清剧毒孢子这类中毒；<b>饥肠辘辘</b>是诅咒，须用净化灵魂；寒冬哨兵的<b>冰川折磨</b>是魔法，交治疗驱散；锐眼掠击鹰的<b>剃刀俯冲</b>是物理流血，萨满驱不掉，叠深了用星界或喊治疗。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="风剪">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-earth">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>地语看护者 · 开场与首领一</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">大地之箭 / 治疗之风</div>
        <div class="why">两个读条轮着读，单点高伤与群体回血都要断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-roar">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>酷寒重殴者 · 冰川</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">冰冷咆哮</div>
        <div class="why">漏断全团急速减半，破冰川之墓与输出都变慢。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-veil">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>碎裂的震颤核心 · 首领二</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">寒冬帷幕</div>
        <div class="why">核心露出就断，漏断全团叠冰霜易伤再吃暴雨。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-arc">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">04</span><span>雷缚秘法师 · 图腾区与尾王</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">电弧 / 闪电箭</div>
        <div class="why">电弧弹 3 人高伤，常被带进尾王，优先断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-nanya">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">05</span><span>神灵代言人纳尼亚 · 图腾区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">闪电箭</div>
        <div class="why">纳尼亚一直读，按分工轮断，轮到就风剪。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里减伤和清毒交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +24 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>星界转移 · 实录施放</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>土元素</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>清毒图腾</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。伤害数字是 +24 实测（含被吸收的部分），层数越高越大。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 囤宝狂人</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 地语看护者 / 锐眼掠击鹰 / 饥渴之灵 / 饥荒雕像 / 棘爪收集者 / 领地主母 / 好奇的幼崽</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>前两大波各交一次星界（两发间隔须 ≥ 90 秒），压<b>剃刀俯冲与苦难盛宴</b>；第二波这发距首领首发咆哮不足 90 秒就跳过，留给首领。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-earth">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241214}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">大地之箭 / 治疗之风</div><div class="s">地语看护者 · 2.5 秒单点自然 / 3.5 秒群体回血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">看护者活着就轮读，盯住一只断到死，顺手续 12 秒风幕。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238439}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剃刀俯冲 + 苦难盛宴</div><div class="s">掠击鹰 10 秒物理流血约 22 万/跳 · 饥渴之灵 5 秒全团暗影约 21 万/跳</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">流血叠深或苦难盛宴开跳时开，两样叠上最值；盛宴吸血回怪，尽快打掉饥渴之灵。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238801}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">饥肠辘辘</div><div class="s">饥荒雕像 · 诅咒 · 最大生命值 −15% · 25 秒可叠加</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:51886}}" alt="">净化灵魂</span><span class="tgt">给叠层队友</span></div>
            <div class="why">上身就驱，叠层的人优先；同时转火雕像停读条。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297701}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">腐烂的补给品 / 母熊之怒</div><div class="s">棘爪收集者留腐烂地面 · 幼崽死时激怒附近母熊</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:79206}}" alt="">灵魂行者的恩赐</span><span class="act-note">出地面，别先杀幼崽</span></div>
            <div class="why">踩到绿地板立即离开，走位开恩赐续读条；幼崽死会激怒附近母熊，留到母熊之后打。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：两大波星界压流血叠苦难盛宴，净化灵魂驱雕像诅咒</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：囤宝狂人 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 囤宝狂人 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>囤宝狂人</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1 · 约 40 秒一发咆哮</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约每 <b>40 秒</b>一发全团咆哮（+9 / +49 / +89 / +130 / +170 / +210 秒），吃到肉堆后变为饕餮怒吼。<b>星界交首发（或第二发）贪婪咆哮，再留给第五发饕餮怒吼</b>，中段土元素转好可挑一发兜底；孢子上身插清毒图腾。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235125}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>贪婪咆哮 / 饕餮怒吼</div><div class="s">3 秒读条 · 落地约 96 万（饕餮约 89 万）无视护甲物理并击退 + 10 秒每秒约 17 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>读条末开星界</b>，12 秒盖住落地和 10 秒持续伤；首发前星界没转好就推到第二发，第五发照样留。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234846}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">腐坏补给 → 剧毒孢子</div><div class="s">+31 秒起每 40 秒 · 投掷约 54 万 + 蘑菇毒雾 12 秒中毒可叠加</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:383013}}" alt="">清毒图腾</span><span class="tgt">清队友孢子</span></div>
            <div class="why">首批孢子开始上身时插下，满 2 分钟后的那轮补给再插；清不完的层数喊治疗驱。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235129}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">骨刺猛击</div><div class="s">4 秒读条 · 前方锥形高伤 · 留 45 秒白骨尖刺</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">离开正面，绕开骨刺</span></div>
            <div class="why">远程站侧面不吃锥形，骨刺扎入每 0.5 秒一跳还减速，别从尖刺上走。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241214}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">连带地语看护者</div><div class="s">若带进首领战，继续读大地之箭（同前段）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">看护者活着就轮流断，先压它血再回首领。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">饕餮怒吼落地每次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">89.2 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:66%">59.0 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交首发与第五发咆哮，孢子上身插清毒图腾</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：林道与冰川 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 林道与冰川 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>林道 → 冰川 → 寒冬哨兵</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 锐眼掠击鹰 / 决意化身 / 酷寒重殴者 / 撼地奔行者 / 霜牙 / 冰川亡魂 / 寒冬暴风雪</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>林道掠击鹰流血转好就交星界；<b>冰川第二大波进雾后扛不住叠伤时再交</b>，距哨兵首轮暴雨须 ≥ 90 秒。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-roar">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1309919}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰冷咆哮</div><div class="s">酷寒重殴者 · 3.5 秒读条 · 全团急速与移速 −50% 15 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">每个都断，急速减半会拖慢破冰川之墓；重殴者粉碎是近战 12 码晕。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241464}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰川之墓</div><div class="s">决意化身 · 2 秒读条全队冻住 · 每 2 秒约 23 万直到破墓</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先破墓</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">冻住后先打自己的墓再回化身；土元素转好可招出抬血上限兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1309964}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">凛冽严冬 + 隆隆结界</div><div class="s">暴风雪雾每 2 秒约 22 万 · 奔行者护盾每 2 秒全团约 13 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">进雾后叠伤压不住血线时补开；雾内外不能互选目标，跟坦克一起进雾。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1252825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">强风 / 冰寒涌动</div><div class="s">风口持续推人 · 冰川亡魂 4 码冰霜冲击</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">贴岩石拿掩护，4 码散开</span></div>
            <div class="why">站岩石后拿「受到掩护。」免推，亡魂附近别和队友挤。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：风剪断冰冷咆哮，先破冰川之墓，进雾叠伤交星界</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：寒冬哨兵 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 寒冬哨兵 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>寒冬哨兵</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2 · 63 秒循环</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>每 <b>63 秒</b>一轮：冰川折磨 → 狂怒的飑风 → 粉碎冰刺露核心 → 寒冰暴雨。<b>星界交首轮暴雨，下一发留给第三轮暴雨</b>；错过则兜底给没及时驱掉的冰川折磨，第二轮靠治疗。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮技能轴（以开打为 0 秒，每 63 秒循环）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+8 秒上身</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235549}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冰川折磨</div><div class="s">魔法 · 16 秒每 2 秒约 39 万冰霜</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">喊治疗驱散</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">等治疗驱；第三轮暴雨没交星界、折磨又没驱掉时兜底补开。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+16 秒落地</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235623}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狂怒的飑风</div><div class="s">冲击点 4 码高伤 · 随后在场地游荡 1.5 分钟并击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲落点，绕开游走旋风</span></div>
            <div class="why">落点和游走旋风都能单下打出百万级伤害，读条就离开落点，走位开恩赐续读条。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step" id="k-veil">
            <div class="when">+28 秒碎裂</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235829}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">粉碎冰刺 → 寒冬帷幕</div><div class="s">冰柱碎裂露出核心 · 4 秒读条全团冰伤 + 冰霜易伤 10% 可叠加</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">躲开冰柱落点，核心起读立刻风剪；打碎后留下雪流，踩着免疫暴雨推人。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+51 秒起读</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235658}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>寒冰暴雨（开始读条）</div><div class="s">4 秒读条 · 每秒全团约 20 万并外推 · 风眼外额外高伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>读条末、起风时开星界</b>，站雪流或贴风眼别被吹出外圈。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">寒冰暴雨每秒吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">19.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:57%">11.1 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交第一、三轮暴雨，风剪核心寒冬帷幕，冰川折磨喊驱</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：图腾区与纳尼亚 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 图腾区与纳尼亚 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>寒冬哨兵 → 纳洛拉克（图腾区）</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 老练的战争使者 / 雷缚秘法师 / 冷酷的图腾召唤者 / 羁绊驯兽师 / 神灵代言人纳尼亚</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span><b>星界必交战争使者原始回响</b>；纳尼亚那发可选，只在距尾王首发回响爆炸 ≥ 90 秒时交，否则留给尾王。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246957}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>原始回响</div><div class="s">老练的战争使者 · 3 秒读条 · 60 码约 61 万无视护甲物理 + 3 秒持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">60 码跑不出，<b>读条末约 1 秒预开</b>，直击压到约 36 万，后续持续伤一并盖住。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-arc">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297778}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">电弧 / 闪电箭</div><div class="s">雷缚秘法师 · 电弧弹射最多 3 人 · 闪电箭 2.5 秒单点</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">电弧优先断，秘法师站后排，远程最好够得着。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">熔岩图腾 / 毒矛乱射</div><div class="s">灼热岩浆每 0.3 秒约 17 万 · 召唤者 4 码毒矛圈</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">先拆熔岩图腾，躲毒矛圈</span></div>
            <div class="why">图腾在就一直喷，落地先集火打掉；读到毒矛乱射看地面走开。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-nanya">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1290205}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">纳尼亚 · 闪电箭</div><div class="s">神灵代言人纳尼亚 · 2.5 秒单点自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">纳尼亚一直读，按分工轮断，轮到你就风剪。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247366}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">地震术 / 动荡图腾</div><div class="s">纳尼亚 4 秒读条 10 码约 64 万 · 图腾无常烈焰每 2.5 秒约 27 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">先出 10 码圈、拆图腾；扛不住且离尾王够 90 秒才交星界。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">原始回响直击每次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">61.1 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:59%">36.3 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界必交原始回响，风剪电弧，纳尼亚那发看离尾王够不够 90 秒</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：纳洛拉克 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 纳洛拉克 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>纳洛拉克（祖尔加拉协助）</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3 · 65 秒双组循环</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>每 <b>65 秒</b>两组：回响重击 → 压制强攻 → 强力猛击，组末战神之怒。回响重击每次点 3 名非坦克，<b>点到你且星界已好就交</b>，没好交土元素，都没好提前喊治疗；连带秘法师继续断电弧。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮技能轴（以开打为 0 秒，每 65 秒循环）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+5 / +30 点名</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1242887}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>回响重击（点名 4 秒）</div><div class="s">到期在脚下生成回响 · 8 码自然约 101 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">出人群 8 码放到边上，<b>爆炸（+9 / +34）前 2–3 秒开星界</b>；首发星界没留好用土元素兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+13 / +38 起读</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297793}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">压制强攻</div><div class="s">3 秒每秒一跳无视护甲物理 · 第 3 下击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">拿防御姿态</span></div>
            <div class="why">跟着祖尔加拉拿到防御姿态（这招减伤 80%），站满三跳再走。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+23 / +48 起读</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297797}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">强力猛击</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 · 砸昏迷的祖尔加拉 6 码内</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">坦克进圈，其他人离开 6 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">必须有人吃（由坦克承接），无人命中会触发挫志怒吼；DPS 别留在圈里。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+54 秒冲锋</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1243408}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">战神之怒 → 回响狂怒</div><div class="s">回响冲向祖尔加拉 · 撞到首个玩家约 39 万自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">按分工挡回响</span></div>
            <div class="why">新旧回响都会冲（每只多冲一轮才消失），按分工站进冲锋路线，漏一只就是挫志怒吼。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">回响重击每次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">101.0 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:63%">64.0 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交回响重击，土元素补空档，防御姿态吃压制强攻</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的元素天赋，英雄天赋先知。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御与功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:381647}}" alt=""><div><b>位面旅行者</b><span>星界转移冷却缩到 90 秒，囤宝狂人、寒冬哨兵与尾王回响重击才能排开两到三发。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1279819}}" alt=""><div><b>始源羁绊</b><span>土元素不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%，专门补星界转移空档。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><b>清毒图腾</b><span>囤宝狂人两轮剧毒孢子各插一根，轮流清掉队友身上的中毒。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:355630}}" alt=""><div><b>风幕</b><span>风剪打断后 12 秒受到的法术伤害 −15%，地语看护者与秘法师读条多，打断频繁时经常吃得到。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">参考录像里的常见改动：去掉<b>幽魂步、静电充能</b>换<b>阵风、冰霜震击、图腾投射</b>；去掉<b>雷霆之爪</b>换<b>幽灵狼</b>；去掉<b>首席升腾者</b>换<b>飞升卓越、喷流</b>；去掉<b>先祖狼魂亲和、图腾集中</b>换<b>大地之盾、治疗链、元素环绕、塞拉赞恩的韧性</b>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>元素萨满 · 纳洛拉克的洞穴 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/BV19wgKxrnZ2dFj8#fight=1">Freaksh +24 27:54</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/jLq6dKR3rMnag87C#fight=3">Stoveteacher +24 28:23</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/GmjDn46rYhbKHzfw#fight=46">坦克不许动 +24 29:38</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/DTNp3wMR7jdCnKWr#fight=11">小电飒 +24 29:42</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/qPRJ78rDw9pXmKG1#fight=13">Fnrsham +24 29:50</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
